{title: 659 - May the Grace of Christ Our Savior}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #659 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 659}
{meta: category Christian Home - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Am]May [C/G]the [F]grace of Christ [Edim]our [F]Savior
[F]And [Am]the [Bb]Father's [C]boundless [F/C]love,
[Dm]With [Am]the [C7/Bb]Holy [Dm/A]Spirit's [Gm]favor,
[F]Rest [Dm/F]upon [Bb]them [Dm]from [C7/Bb]above.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Am]Thus [C/G]may [F]they abide [Edim]in [F]union
[F]With [Am]each [Bb]other [C]and the [F/C]Lord,
[Dm]And [Am]possess, in [Dm/A]sweet [Gm]communion,
[F]Joys [Dm/F]which [C]earth [Bb]cannot [C7/Bb]afford.
{end_of_verse}
